ocations that will experience flash flooding include...\nSullivan, Cuba, Bourbon, Anthonies Mill, Leasburg, Richwoods, Old\nMines, St. Cloud and Oak Hill.\n\nThis includes the following State Parks...\nWashington State Park and Onondaga Cave State Park.\n\nThis includes Interstate 44 in Missouri between exits 203 and 218.","instruction":"Be especially cautious at night when it is harder to recognize the\ndangers of flooding.\n\nIn hilly terrain there are hundreds of low water crossings which are\npotentially dangerous in heavy rain. Do not attempt to cross flooded\nroads. Find an alternate route.","response":"Avoid","note":null,"parameters":{"AWIPSidentifier":["FFSLSX"],"WMOidentifier":["WGUS73 KLSX 010334"],"NWSheadline":["FLASH FLOOD WARNING REMAINS IN EFFECT UNTIL 1145 PM CDT THIS EVENING FOR NORTHERN CRAWFORD AND NORTHERN WASHINGTON COUNTIES IN EAST CENTRAL MISSOURI"],"flashFloodDetection":["RADAR INDICATED"],"BLOCKCHANNEL":["EAS","NWEM","CMAS"],"EAS-ORG":["WXR"],"VTEC":["/O.CON.KLSX.FF.W.0057.000000T0000Z-260801T0445Z/"],"eventEndingTime":["2026-07-31T23:45:00-05:00"]},"scope":"Public","code":"IPAWSv1.0","language":"en-US","web":"http://www.weather.gov","eventCode":{"SAME":["FFS"],"NationalWeatherService":["FFW"]}}},{"id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.9c3b4198ba6f37d2462d3e188fee7fc86d742f9e.001.1","type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-91.53,37.96],[-91.54,38],[-91.41,38.03],[-91.38,38.02],[-91.26,38.07],[-91.22,38.01],[-91.3,38],[-91.35,37.96],[-91.53,37.96]]]},"properties":{"@id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.9c3b4198ba6f37d2462d3e188fee7fc86d742f9e.001.1","@type":"wx:Alert","id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.9c3b4198ba6f37d2462d3e188fee7fc86d742f9e.001.1","areaDesc":"Crawford, MO","geocode":{"SAME":["029055"],"UGC":["MOC055"]},"affectedZones":["https://api.weather.gov/zones/county/MOC055"],"references":[],"sent":"2026-07-31T21:29:00-05:00","effective":"2026-07-31T21:29:00-05:00","onset":"2